# Game manuals, field drawings and CAD downloaded from FIRST.
#
# Excluded for two independent reasons, either of which is sufficient. They are not ours to
# redistribute: they are FIRST's copyrighted material, and a public mirror of them is a
# redistribution however well intentioned. And they are 245 MB of this folder's 270 MB, which
# makes every clone of this repository pay for files anybody can download from FIRST directly.
#
# Everything that reads them still works on a machine that has them. Nothing in this repository
# depends on them being version controlled.
manuals/

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# Python bytecode and editor backups.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]
